CDS	child DS
CERT	certificate
CNAME	canonical name
CSYNC	child-to-parent synchronization
DHCID	DHCP identifier
DLV	DNSSEC lookaside validation
DNAME	delegation name
DNSKEY	DNSKEY record
DS	delegation signer
EUI48	48-bit MAC address
EUI64	64-bit MAC address
HINFO	host information
HIP	host identity protocol
HTTPS	HTTPS binding
IPSECKEY	IPsec key
ISDN	ISDN address
IXFR	incremental zone transfer
KEY	key record
KX	key exchanger
L32	32-bit locator
L64	64-bit locator
LOC	location information
LP	locator pointer
MB	mailbox domain name
MD	mail destination (obsolete)
MF	mail forwarder (obsolete)
MG	mail group member
MINFO	mailbox information
MR	mail rename
MX	mail exchange
NAPTR	naming authority pointer
NID	node identifier
NS	name server
NSAP	NSAP address
NSAP-PTR	NSAP pointer
NSEC	next secure
NSEC3	next secure v3
NSEC3PARAM	NSEC3 parameters
NULL	null record
NXT	next domain (obsolete)
OPENPGPKEY	OpenPGP key
PTR	domain name pointer
PX	pointer to X.400
RP	responsible person
RT	route through
SIG	signature
SINK	sink record
SOA	start of authority
SRV	service locator
SSHFP	SSH fingerprint
SVCB	service binding
